+/*
+ * THE FIELD CATALOG -- the one definition of the tuple's layout and meaning. The managed
+ * bridge mirrors these indices (AssemblyLoadContext.Mono.cs) and the regressions index by
+ * them; nothing restates their meaning.
+ *
+ * The four class-attribution buckets are CONTIGUOUS and in the sgen bucket order
+ * { normal, pinned, weak, weak-track-resurrection }, so the fill copies them with one loop.
+ * ALC_SNAPSHOT_STRONG_HANDLES is the base of that run; the static assert below pins it.
+ */
