+/*
+ * Compute one condemned-set snapshot and write it to the caller's buffer. Returns the number
+ * of fields written: ALC_SNAPSHOT_FIELD_COUNT on success, 0 if the buffer cannot hold the
+ * whole tuple (see the BUFFER CONTRACT note; it is all-or-nothing on purpose, so a rejected
+ * call leaves a stale buffer stale rather than half-updated).
