+ * bound -- empty and metadata slots included, since they cost the same pointer load as an
+ * occupied one and bounding that load is the entire point. Counting it in the loop keeps the
+ * published figure from drifting away from the loop that produced it; it does NOT make a
+ * miscounting implementation detectable from outside, because this return value is the only
+ * channel through which the bound is observable at all. See the note at the definition.
+ */
